# Crossroads_07 from the arrival at the bottom (x 23.0 y 4.39 once he has climbed out of the shaft) up the room's ledges to the one at y 37.6 and left
# along the passage to the gate into Crossroads_11_alt (arrival x 119.5, y 12.4). Planned with hk-walkplan room (margin 0.7: its Climbers and Flies take
# a mask from a narrow landing at 0.4) with the whole run from the Mound before it as the pre fragment, so the SOUL of the Mound's spell is there for the
# heals. The ledge at y 37.6 has a Climber that does not leave it: land at its right end (x 21.4) and kill it (`fight 6`) before the passage.
at 23.00 4.39
walk 22.72
walk 23.15   # run-up
walk 22.72   # take-off
hold left+cross for 16
hold left for 25
wait 6
wait until HK_WALK_READY == 1 timeout 300
